    "work_id": "anf-works/papias-fragments",
    "canonical_ref": "Papias.iv.s9",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "for five books were composed by him. And he added, saying, “Now these things are credible to believers.",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 120,
    "date_range": [
