    "work_id": "anf-works/papias-fragments",
    "canonical_ref": "Papias.iv.s11",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "These, then, are the times mentioned by the prophet Isaiah: ‘And the wolf shall lie down with the lamb,’ etc. (Isa. xi. 6 ff.).”]",
    "chunk_index": 23,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
